Source: keyloom-rust-toolchain
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Blake Gardner <blakerg@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://www.rust-lang.org/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: keyloom-rust-toolchain
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gcc, libc6-dev
Description: Rust toolchain used to build Keyloom packages
 The upstream Rust compiler, standard library, and Cargo, installed under
 /usr/lib/keyloom-rust-toolchain so that Keyloom can be built on
 distributions whose own Rust packages are older than Keyloom's
 dependencies require. It is a build dependency of the keyloom package
 and is not needed to run Keyloom.
